previews and restart status (#3806)\n\nStandardizes two existing UI paths so they follow shared feedback rules\ninstead of behaving as special cases.\n\nSearch-result previews (`grep`/`glob`) now apply both line and character\ncaps, matching shell/file output. Long single-line or dense multi-line\nsearch results collapse behind the normal expand affordance instead of\noverflowing the preview budget.\n\n`/restart` now emits an in-chat start message and only reports\ncompletion when the server respawn actually succeeds. Restart helpers\nreturn a success boolean so failure paths can rely on the existing\nrecovery UI without also showing a false success message.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"86afb099d7378b572c71c42e31212100a953368c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/86afb099d7378b572c71c42e31212100a953368c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/71a6d508b21b275c0c7c6bd2e0752adfba496ea9","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKHOWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtT0QAGjYddCl98lUOVj+VLcBYXQt\nU2AU7W6NciL1Hr0BvhMeD+9/JaRpbgVo5zSP6Cu9ZJuAfDTOc1HOJU8tF1GNBgvw\n3lSWbigAAtCSg+JGUXHxis24OnB2anNgSBr48AUCGnZDYRdkcJuGiPMMoJ3a1i/t\nNdaHqDwKNcoIaYDJTxrCezGehpgUqhpIys8nEVMW2JdaTHEhShjoSwPcxAbPL0Sj\nAm6LJIHHdGH8CDGkbLqLkYz3EubbEa333cY8NU1glhKdWph2Ez9cy7rnq5f8W5nO\nYBIzMQe2xuG4PKGCr5z7KfypWhBHSXRRQMRIyPL8MA0soPVhIp/5t6M/Ykj+K8aI\n8CtoWnBQG1Q1oKQnZKkg+On2nvkQ/GQCjrvx5FTg9zv6DUS2YrkZEutakvmaTdn6\nEhGsThqk4rIUL9+sH3bjITrdHtlII4AT+aLao+33bY16Xy6MaHVu+wpW300LPaLN\nl4yZ2NFVareP3Kc+Bo03YcTTG+5J8EhA7wyDPezowLrSuuiyg6hLRswdvrj80VTa\n7zZOiI628qm+7Xx7NpSPHW8IYJXphRpSLpeL2oJ/6EMBfo5tvlSFfR1D95VX4ddM\nHxBDZAk7skjJzjEbs3/14+LLUhzsV5z9sizuW2ZMpNrWr/zEV0EYaBAkq6StyzzO\noHy98knLVW66XgP2aI0H\n=7mW5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 86afb099d7378b572c71c42e31212100a953368c\nparent c40bef9b2aaace3909593503b28e8b548bc20014\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781035926 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781035926 -0400\n\nfix(code): standardize search previews and restart status (#3806)\n\nStandardizes two existing UI paths so they follow shared feedback rules\ninstead of behaving as special cases.\n\nSearch-result previews (`grep`/`glob`) now apply both line and character\ncaps, matching shell/file output. Long single-line or dense multi-line\nsearch results collapse behind the normal expand affordance instead of\noverflowing the preview budget.\n\n`/restart` now emits an in-chat start message and only reports\ncompletion when the server respawn actually succeeds. Restart helpers\nreturn a success boolean so failure paths can rely on the existing\nrecovery UI without also showing a false success message.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-09T20:12:07Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/71a6d508b21b275c0c7c6bd2e0752adfba496ea9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/71a6d508b21b275c0c7c6bd2e0752adfba496ea9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/71a6d508b21b275c0c7c6bd2e0752adfba496ea9/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subsc