","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"04b4bb946fc5ff914b8cccc8c9543d10533de0f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/04b4bb946fc5ff914b8cccc8c9543d10533de0f8","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/04b4bb946fc5ff914b8cccc8c9543d10533de0f8"}]},{"sha":"04b4bb946fc5ff914b8cccc8c9543d10533de0f8","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDA0YjRiYjk0NmZjNWZmOTE0YjhjY2NjOGM5NTQzZDEwNTMzZGUwZjg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Victor Moreira","email":"victor@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-07T21:05:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-07T21:05:02Z"},"message":"fix(cli): support `state` deploy backend (#3790)\n\nUpdates the deploy CLI backend handling to match the current Managed\nDeep Agents API shape. New scaffolded projects use `state`, and\nsandbox-backed projects can use `backend.type: \"sandbox\"` with\n`sandbox_config.scope`, policy IDs, and TTL fields. Existing `default`,\n`thread_scoped_sandbox`, `agent_scoped_sandbox`, and `backend.sandbox`\nconfigs continue to normalize for compatibility.\n\nThis also updates the CLI README and example deploy project so users see\nthe canonical `sandbox_config` form.\n\nTests run:\n- `uv run --group test python -m pytest tests/unit_tests/`\n- `uv run --group test ruff check deepagents_cli/deploy/project.py\ndeepagents_cli/deploy/commands.py\ntests/unit_tests/deploy/test_project.py\ntests/unit_tests/deploy/test_payload.py\ntests/unit_tests/deploy/test_init_command.py\ntests/unit_tests/deploy/test_deploy_command.py`\n- `uv run --group test ty check deepagents_cli/deploy/project.py`\n\nLive validation:\n- Created a temporary Managed Deep Agent using `backend.type: \"sandbox\"`\nand `sandbox_config.scope: \"thread\"`.\n- Confirmed the API stored `type: \"sandbox\"` and `sandbox_config.scope:\n\"thread\"`.\n- Updated the same temporary agent with `idle_ttl_seconds` and\n`delete_after_stop_seconds`; confirmed both fields persisted.\n- Deleted the temporary remote agent and verified it returned 404\nafterward.","tree":{"sha":"0f68292cb0ef59dbf0e04c5c141b5340fb954da9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/0f68292cb0ef59dbf0e04c5c141b5340fb954da9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/04b4bb946fc5ff914b8cccc8c9543d10533de0f8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJdz+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAs7gQAJbV8kGaQo3qmcLGh+3pani0\nFq9cVJ1rWjoBfe56coJvM9AcZnzOTJjxEYiQmAkXx9/UUqJvliiAUdITj94XGDB8\nzVHuvtB8hKfbboLdahqTaGqv0TKJ/GWUlLkqLVdUAqsL/W/CejVcxT8KNVYKabDQ\n2AlQYB9kmwdOHgqlTsyr0/ngk6PS3e+GSUuGZtZDQf3I8xPwvqzI6FMsU6a3eJLp\nR90xgWQvbruLoOgUz+waqCRpce3Nk8QDiwknX5mjrCpm2JqdDKfCsBzPB8Tm+CLe\nP9HVtuCYq6BnguabvcgbsV3vpNaoS/bLVdrOwy+t5rMvg4/DZYhvykOKojuEtMpX\nlWc7/P7arx/0oyYBwfvJ4WceMdZggDvr7LAIjHXZPKJkRJjDnoE0lSc4sV5wJ57V\n0gcarRVPXnra71nwRGBgLikQDTNLtSjp3bLvLpRG+JwKtXnan0HFAxG1aFNhuj7q\nrSJwjout6X5zkgQfeIPwX2/bgohq5xy0riGRMteKuHiEHYj48pnESEBzyMNrqEE6\nleu68tAhYEoXmXn0MfaR8Oa7jPr4ThhmvgcNpstGTIj0lpfmvdOQJl0vKIcSGWUt\nN8RCO557MKkU4LASU/LVCDQRC5jtSwmA92IAVu9jDktVb3a0qfCWXqjgMOprjlnF\nXZ9mwk36utt1xl6QlVTa\n=I4Ph\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 0f68292cb0ef59dbf0e04c5c141b5340fb954da9\nparent b476c8870de5e4e5fbd3b13da59433f8f1c2c395\nauthor Victor Moreira <victor@langchain.dev> 1780866302 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780866302 -0400\n\nfix(cli): support `state` deploy backend (#3790)\n\nUpdates the deploy CLI backend handling to match the current Managed\nDeep Agents API shape. New scaffolded projects use `state`, and\nsandbox-backed projects can use `backend.type: \"sandbox\"` with\n`sandbox_config.scope`, policy IDs, and TTL fields. Existing `default`,\n`thread_scoped_sandbox`, `agent_scoped_sandbox`, and `backend.sandbox`\nconfigs continue to normalize for compatibility.\n\nThis also updates the CLI README and example deploy project so users see\nthe canonical `sandbox_config` form.\n\nTests run:\n- `uv run --group test python -m pytest tests/unit_tests/`\n- `uv run --group test ruff check deepagents_cli/deploy/project.py\ndeepagents_cli/deploy/commands.py\ntests/unit_tests/deploy/test_project.py\ntests/unit_tests/deploy/test_payload.py\ntests/unit_tests/deploy/test_init_command.py\ntests/unit_tests/deploy/test_deploy_command.py`\n- `uv run --group test ty check deepagents_cli/deploy/project.py`\n\nLive validation:\n- Created a temporary Managed Deep Agent using `backend.type: \"sandbox\"`\nand `sandbox_config.scope: \"thread\"`.\n- Confirmed the API stored `type: \"sandbox\"` and `sandbox_config.scope:\n\"thread\"`.\n- Updated the same temporary agent with `idle_ttl_seconds` and\n`delete_after_stop_seconds`; confirmed both fields persisted.\n- Deleted the temporary remote agent and verified it returned 404\nafterward.","verified_at":"2026-06-07T21:05:02Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/04b4bb946fc5ff914b8cccc8c9543d10533de0f8","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/04b4bb946fc5ff914b8cccc8c9543d10533de0f8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/04b4bb946fc5ff914b8cccc8c9543d10533de0f8/comments","author":{"login":"victorm-lc","id":207930161,"node_id":"U_kgDODGTDMQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207930161?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorm-lc","html_url":"https://github.com/victorm-lc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorm-lc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorm-lc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorm-lc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorm-lc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorm-lc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorm-lc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorm-lc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorm-lc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorm-lc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b476c8870de5e4e5fbd3b13da59433f8f1c2c395","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b476c8870de5e4e5fbd3b13da59433f8f1c2c395","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b476c8870de5e4e5fbd3b13da59433f8f1c2c395"}]},{"sha":"b476c8870de5e4e5fbd3b13da59433f8f1c2c395","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGI0NzZjODg3MGRlNWU0ZTVmYmQzYjEzZGE1OTQzM2Y4ZjFjMmMzOTU","commit":{"author":{"name":"dependabot[bot]","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-07T20:15:24Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-07T20:15:24Z"},"message":"chore(deps): bump pyarrow from 22.0.0 to 23.0.1 in /libs/code (#3785)\n\nBumps [pyarrow](https://github.com/apache/arrow) from 22.0.0 to 23.0.1.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/apache/arrow/releases\">pyarrow's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Apache Arrow 23.0.1</h2>\n<p>Release Notes URL: <a\nhref=\"https://arrow.apache.org/release/23.0.1.html\">https://arrow.apache.org/release/23.0.1.html</a></p>\n<h2>Apache Arrow 23.0.1 RC0</h2>\n<p>Release Notes: Release Candidate: 23.0.1 RC0</p>\n<h2>Apache Arrow 23.0.0</h2>\n<p>Release Notes URL: <a\nhref=\"https://arrow.apache.org/release/23.0.0.html\">https://arrow.apache.org/release/23.0.0.html</a></p>\n<h2>Apache Arrow 23.0.0 RC2</h2>\n<p>Release Notes: Release Candidate: 23.0.0 RC2</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/apache/arrow/commit/82a374e5f3de5b744f26591e6cd96de6349c76d9\"><code>82a374e</code></a>\nMINOR: [Release] Update versions for 23.0.1</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/apache/arrow/commit/c1ae37c4a597f466b1806e65a9e011be1060dfc5\"><code>c1ae37c</code></a>\nMINOR: [Release] Update .deb/.rpm changelogs for 23.0.1</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/apache/arrow/commit/8f6e55736f60f1f95aee1e8765c6b75ad9589111