it tests:\n- test_passes_middleware_to_create_agent_at_construction — verifies\nmiddleware is forwarded to create_agent when the swarm tool is built\n- test_passes_middleware_to_variant_recompilation — verifies middleware\nis forwarded when a response_schema triggers a new agent variant\n- test_defaults_to_empty_middleware_when_not_specified — verifies\nbackwards compatibility (no middleware = empty list)","tree":{"sha":"d91413e171a7d6da8e6aa197531b302f2b51321c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/d91413e171a7d6da8e6aa197531b302f2b51321c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/3394a9d9c7c89c0a28fa1328c9f6bae68a83ff14","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIKkmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/MAQAAMo35Ul+WWXHSb8u2CJ2duN\nVAq7tzuJz0IVfSjLq9TjvZ/mQPxb406TpHmeLFFmELH2j7FKfeR5/2Dy8J0slMSC\nZdj1LJ1XzWdiVuvU0Lf+yahqvjGK4lS5J//mapq5E6vgoflTAc0uaI1uavM/P9Nq\n/CktIuDzYFDHtL4Mo70vvEB39BiH+Zi4+HpYYRT/Nviwj2xeIBqVnK/h8wj/+N7e\nMLjUfpHcBecQkDDPr6IDtKz3TajY1jTWORpC2xWHwlmoiIQJRjChw5ERnqLtp7nE\nYj0WNE2KYftfQ4piLEAmvGdghIkNMUzjCv1mCKxW30kBKOXxxTjHUksUdW0qkPM/\nzanZ2xZsM3b0DkZ3ST+W2KzKzsy084TbueSudFy9MTOT+bgJ42/3nN8/oTRu3Ju3\nVi01Xm0ErqmQ2/jxkCRn1nNIfeV7CZt5qNCL/M+7TqRf0XIAE9TLKs1qyvj0FUoR\nVP8nvImp7Dy8pNcHflxLXm1uVoAIxvhBTejW4WnxND8s1jMtFCwzdo2evCJsT+qK\n3AMF1sdmstHMgX+U/bTI74a1dHOEVZaGoimrcHvpr8pcfGjKDaWT/wjsAdmjy8tN\nvQDJtV38oKhd/49wiJodrXCgUlJo+VGatG46g1MfRWBcIZH57BcWA+6ElPVw0lEf\nZ1MJo8TJIx9k9KUVArDr\n=SW3Q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree d91413e171a7d6da8e6aa197531b302f2b51321c\nparent 867a2e5c341bd9dfa70b47c7fafc194ac51d7469\nauthor Colin Francis <131073567+colifran@users.noreply.github.com> 1780525350 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780525350 -0700\n\nfix(quickjs): swarm subagent doesn't allow configuring middleware (#3757)\n\n### Summary\n\nThis PR exposes a middleware option for swarm subagents to allow\nconfiguring middleware with swarm subagents.\n\n ### Tests\n\nAdded 3 unit tests:\n- test_passes_middleware_to_create_agent_at_construction — verifies\nmiddleware is forwarded to create_agent when the swarm tool is built\n- test_passes_middleware_to_variant_recompilation — verifies middleware\nis forwarded when a response_schema triggers a new agent variant\n- test_defaults_to_empty_middleware_when_not_specified — verifies\nbackwards compatibility (no middleware = empty list)","verified_at":"2026-06-03T22:22:31Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3394a9d9c7c89c0a28fa1328c9f6bae68a83ff14","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3394a9d9c7c89c0a28fa1328c9f6bae68a83ff14","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3394a9d9c7c89c0a28fa1328c9f6bae68a83ff14/comments","author":{"login":"colifran","id":131073567,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9AGHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131073567?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran","html_url":"https://github.com/colifran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colifran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"867a2e5c341bd9dfa70b47c7fafc194ac51d7469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/867a2e5c341bd9dfa70b47c7fafc194ac51d7469","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/867a2e5c341bd9dfa70b47c7fafc194ac51d7469"}]},{"sha":"867a2e5c341bd9dfa70b47c7fafc194ac51d7469","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDg2N2EyZTVjMzQxYmQ5ZGZhNzBiNDdjN2ZhZmMxOTRhYzUxZDc0Njk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-03T21:25:18Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-03T21:25:18Z"},"message":"fix(code): keep startup import prewarm from crashing the TUI mid-upgrade (#3756)\n\nThe startup prewarm worker eagerly imports internal modules to warm\n`sys.modules`, but let any `ImportError` propagate. When the installed\npackage is replaced in place during a session — e.g. a concurrent `uv\ntool upgrade deepagents-code` rewriting the tool environment — a\nnot-yet-imported module is transiently absent on disk, so the deferred\nimport raises `ModuleNotFoundError`. Because the worker runs with\nTextual's default `exit_on_error=True`, that surfaced as a fatal\nfull-screen traceback over a race that resolves itself moments later.","tree":{"sha":"51a4bbeb0b40075ed6172591c5cbd051aa351fd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/51a4bbeb0b40075ed6172591c5cbd051aa351fd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/867a2e5c341bd9dfa70b47c7fafc194ac51d7469","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIJu+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIf8QAKTtG+2T3JBy642EEcz8ozn1\nnRyeN/jB3xCqf4vRYad6e0dzAKlXji3AMYFLbjjV0LytEd1b11r+MOq2bpHHkWaO\nu4dQ+LbT/HNbVoutABEtgse6BXHP0yFy0Fha5/0kis0sWCh0QOfkSCd3o6hfGS3z\ntIqNgz1lu4OZuExeZwzPWC2aXGuaqZpxKNRMMP9FZbHPv0d1V7L5SRoqXBgp7ReW\nKgM58ZFF4du3EnTYyr/QTygeEfR+p/1arJEE95jJaacGMB5/D5Tc3B4iMdGrbdcu\nwg1Cu04FP0gbuuSaNLIxPJQVDioBWdzY5fz1YVnxPO6996yY7FLSzH2MrakzhkAM\nC/RRG0WEgn+nrtFUH6vDmANAl9ClVvOnX1SK0Cckc/9MZf1Rj8czQAUcyDY6CcB7\nYDb7/ofKYr8g65F7X7rOkXqduQQbRq6fi0RTwH0eimqiKqgak2SRlh/gX1vasTOU\nd1ZQScbC1t4+ZFWN3UfBiiaLEn7hBrNTSgq8Op7mxsBbzNI/6aqTU5mrqI2xF/tE\nklgiQl4dM0pltcb+VxutIlYVG2CVcEgslqFNVlB+s/JDloKKksTKlYn31sFEQdfz\nNUni3oFJd8RKM/u81tD2fybDjLCBDRjVbKgXJh4Fp19kGtNgpl8UEL7A9tx1eY38\n/lpgH1HzPXSpDzdQqOEM\n=wqQY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 51a4bbeb0b40075ed6172591c5cbd051aa351fd0\nparent 0c05dc69ce07beae890dd16031e8eb2b5736b7b2\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1780521918 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780521918 -0400\n\nfix(code): keep startup import prewarm from crashing the TUI mid-upgrade (#3756)\n\nThe startup prewarm worker eagerly imports internal modules to warm\n`sys.modules`, but let any `ImportError` propagate. When the installed\npackage is replaced in place during a session — e.g. a concurrent `uv\ntool upgrade deepagents-code` rewriting the tool environment — a\nnot-yet-imported module is transiently absent on disk, so the deferred\nimport raises `ModuleNotFoundError`. Because the worker runs with\nTextual's default `exit_on_error=True`, that surfaced as a fatal\nfull-screen traceback over a race that resolves itself moments later.","verified_at":"2026-06-03T21:25:19Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/867a2e5c341bd9dfa70b47c7fafc194ac51d7469","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/867a2e5c341bd9dfa70b47c7fafc194ac51d7469","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/867a2e5c341bd9dfa70b47c7fafc194ac51d7469/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/use