ss, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.0.8](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-acp==0.0.7...deepagents-acp==0.0.8)\n(2026-06-03)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Require `agent-client-protocol>=0.9.0`\n([#3733](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3733))\n([376d981](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/376d9816833ef02a00fd4f1c4ccdf625629c36a4))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"cedf8cf9fed780e9ca56c19db5be0e4d87e717ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/cedf8cf9fed780e9ca56c19db5be0e4d87e717ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/b816ca178f6cb8c34933513756aa3932b8120631","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIGy0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhDoQAA5ygujmQufa2XnrQGuD7f4K\nR9EV2zXYpm9MWx2YNIH2rcn+5aBYP9rw/mxDHiaYRvyj4kOQVzuN5cEtXUhmIxVJ\nZOIL7NWzfydwjIZ0c5b5NPkU65sLCnW1E7TWbffTWj2Udb77ho71FmjKkUS3D31W\nUddZT4t+97M+h1vskM661U06A5olXvQSua1vIroUgVHdEKE1ObvF3E55h2t/AALN\nT2YtLVlZmlKN/GWpHPqJWO6c5pjvQFYRbmb5SVbFs29eUSuP5DOV+Z2UjukW4ERP\nPURwg3/g2tntf1Z19e3MZGaeN7GM5Jtf1DZnI8tdF2CLsfu8onkW0SdtLQwyJ6pU\nMvt9oNj4mA9DX5+9g3EWyxyrPqh1jTbg3mi5TNp5X/bytHfjSYJlod0QVE+QKvSR\nv8iSeb7djp88raJuRwmu4D7fTCbGCfkdnw352/bW7Nz5wV4udqLtX2QsAHId484s\nlYGMYMaRzuKwfhtCtKA7IilYNl3E/qG8QBS4W1