pos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e0a1ed24e6b44c31d0aac3358aeee0d6cb66b2c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e0a1ed24e6b44c31d0aac3358aeee0d6cb66b2c4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e0a1ed24e6b44c31d0aac3358aeee0d6cb66b2c4"}]},{"sha":"e0a1ed24e6b44c31d0aac3358aeee0d6cb66b2c4","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGUwYTFlZDI0ZTZiNDRjMzFkMGFhYzMzNThhZWVlMGQ2Y2I2NmIyYzQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nick Hollon","email":"nick.hollon@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-02T20:30:43Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-02T20:30:43Z"},"message":"feat(sdk): surface subagents via inherited lc_agent_name projection (#3644)\n\nRemoves deepagents' bespoke `SubagentTransformer` and its scope-factory\nwiring. Subagents already bind `lc_agent_name` (including\n`CompiledSubAgent` for raw graphs), so the `SubagentTransformer` that\n`create_agent` now registers (langchain-ai/langchain#37739) surfaces\nthem on `run.subagents` automatically — with no per-tool `subagent_name`\nannotation and no `subagent_type`-arg parsing. The `task` tool drops its\n`subagent_name=` declaration accordingly.\n\nAlso keeps the `ensure_config`-merge propagation work so a subagent\ninherits the parent's user metadata while preserving its own bound\n`lc_agent_name` (deepagents#3634).\n\nDepends on langchain-ai/langchain#37739 and langchain-ai/langgraph#7928\n(both unreleased) — pinned via temporary git revs in\n`[tool.uv.sources]`; replace with released floors before merge.","tree":{"sha":"c0fad942cffb2af47fcc82010b2dc5729ca4da0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/c0fad942cffb2af47fcc82010b2dc5729ca4da0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/e0a1ed24e6b44c31d0aac3358aeee0d6cb66b2c4","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHz1zCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiHAQAK1jB2I9RUqm9cT0wzDvOcml\nzhEfDoZKFJL1DjSb/Ihon0YHMYFN5Q0+fDAAzkOaTfBp17o2Fx63B4qvjQt8z3tB\nIerAdxv1TMGRiGstxxIOgIBb+onPy+kdShHBbjPYtmkvIbqqRZMYCneAAKRdUsfE\naLyQWjBQ80EV3WkMBLRB6/RX2yoDLYUWEaHLbmAkDJFcUrNWZzwig+GsiN8kFGNC\n6iwZs7Blb6+Z4uZXhoCJt2kRG3tX0ZrIwfgsbmCntWd8FhRor6jAZnVeAEGLSrGO\n8/Nn4d4e8bEwn0jNaVwQ7SgnwbH7eD0xuKRihUvZtV/6dT+RAlhJykGuKW0iRE6J\nhHVNsIsgfkr3ZwVkoETzCCo8Ii0JazTZ4xWqg8GkL+KHFwm8gNjEjELdeaMbNOLa\nFoeGv39INOjOLuYKN58dYyA8lnPovA7RhKqUxF8wsEY/iO8IFiwH4N4/oe1wpofc\nfa8nnMX2V3pCUyN0Ivw+7CRIrmd2SNTzLKmOlRyCk9IKEwzFrRazZcSxBE77Xv3d\nwHCMo57J1P8D3r4vI3e9vJxBF8g+yydumJlkEPwHnng5e4WVsTirEMoEVTCAOtdO\n2SfMdEE1JOp+drlm1tLhKqsBb0Xec3g9ax8yxSGTBrfrUq93AY2n8O7qTOXSkjzj\ntThjtkSPi5dZYRaWrcvB\n=g5sI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c0fad942cffb2af47fcc82010b2dc5729ca4da0b\nparent fb2adc0585e978b12646602ba922e252abf41f81\nauthor Nick Hollon <nick.hollon@langchain.dev> 1780432243 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780432243 -0400\n\nfeat(sdk): surface subagents via inherited lc_agent_name projection (#3644)\n\nRemoves deepagents' bespoke `SubagentTransformer` and its scope-factory\nwiring. Subagents already bind `lc_agent_name` (including\n`CompiledSubAgent` for raw graphs), so the `SubagentTransformer` that\n`create_agent` now registers (langchain-ai/langchain#37739) surfaces\nthem on `run.subagents` automatically — with no per-tool `subagent_name`\nannotation and no `subagent_type`-arg parsing. The `task` tool drops its\n`subagent_name=` declaration accordingly.\n\nAlso keeps the `ensure_config`-merge propagation work so a subagent\ninherits the parent's user metadata while preserving its own bound\n`lc_agent_name` (deepagents#3634).\n\nDepends on langchain-ai/langchain#37739 and langchain-ai/langgraph#7928\n(both unreleased) — pinned via temporary git revs in\n`[tool.uv.sources]`; replace with released floors before merge.","verified_at":"2026-06-02T20:30:43Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e0a1ed24e6b44c31d0aac3358aeee0d6cb66b2c4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e0a1ed24e6b44c31d0aac3358aeee0d6cb66b2c4","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e0a1ed24e6b44c31d0aac3358aeee0d6cb66b2c4/comments","author":{"login":"nick-hollon-lc","id":274035459,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFVzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274035459?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc","html_url":"https://github.com/nick-hollon-lc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"fb2adc0585e978b12646602ba922e252abf41f81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fb2adc0585e978b12646602ba922e252abf41f81","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/fb2adc0585e978b12646602ba922e252abf41f81"}]},{"sha":"fb2adc0585e978b12646602ba922e252abf41f81","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGZiMmFkYzA1ODVlOTc4YjEyNjQ2NjAyYmE5MjJlMjUyYWJmNDFmODE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-02T20:23:24Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-02T20:23:24Z"},"message":"fix(code): serialize cold SDK imports (#3712)\n\nCold import paths that enter the Deep Agents SDK now share a\nprocess-local reentrant lock, avoiding CPython import deadlock failures\nwhen startup, skill discovery, and token-budget code hit overlapping\nmodule graphs at the same time. Model creation and skill discovery run\nthrough locked helpers so worker-thread paths use the same import gate\nwithout blocking the event loop.\n\n## Changes\n- Added `_DEEPAGENTS_IMPORT_LOCK` as a process-local `RLock` for Deep\nAgents SDK import entry points that can be reached concurrently during\ncold startup.\n- Routed model creation through\n`_create_model_with_deepagents_import_lock`, including server startup,\nrestored-thread model recreation, and token-budget model construction.\n- Routed skill discovery through\n`_discover_skills_and_roots_with_import_lock` for startup discovery and\ncache-miss `/skill` invocation paths.\n- Wrapped prewarm imports and summarization-default imports with the\nshared import gate so prewarm, skill discovery, and model setup do not\nrace through the same module graph.\n\n## Testing\n- Added coverage that cache-miss skill invocation uses the guarded\ndiscovery path instead of calling `_discover_skills_and_roots` directly.\n- Updated the startup import-gate test to assert model creation waits on\nthe shared process-level import lock.","tree":{"sha":"d70202df3a44ec7e57888d30e50f834cedb85d4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/d70202df3a44ec7e57888d30e50f834cedb85d4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/fb2adc0585e978b12646602ba922e252abf41f81","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHzu8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0ywQAAE52v1W+J5fNOFkhnYLJL3U\noRdIgmHgeZEFeP/6yRYNHuGu22pMlsmTYW6/Me7jeKiMwl66Yi+QcBnHg2sw5mzi\nVF8H6QQf60+kVfO+eNC7JAcvTLln8im+P429kikFcNzx5QrJ0Gx+I7PAoedVw3pQ\nhzQ64bmvKySao0glqSpstkxInccjmSqCEtsC3mB8DgUPdSYs95mJHdbCjWqr9pGO\nIVpd6UqnSpADJBa+/7KhjYSwiUgpKsKMPx3xtsTKB82WJMWSLsuPPl1bNuq5LNnD\nUho9ggb+ezwn1sbHuDMU5cdkXk0SvoU+SPFrBO9lZ2oeqWkdhMMWUnx7oESK9AR+\nn5h8R2kf0At7bjDYzIVMz29W0t3y8bk3rHJ3heGWOjw7z+zt0RKV5MECuYw9kHiX\noWPHbFwMqwR/qko9zISFFxGJzi/5nfWjbZVpnLMKaro4wb+uWnlii4TUKTHnHAG3\nAE6Yfup8TGfdDYuvyT70OVcAjLX+/AsImR/mzsHYugwbdVrsA0dCSNXLuVYAWEUe\ndqJW5xTphG0I7M1a1LV1MrVG7OrnPQT1Yuhxw602GwRN+lGMHtGf03KvbpQcdPQV\nOO4iNpnlYaxzK2bAM95hGhHplsF6IBNPO76OevF4Qf26+QuCvUpZbyXHtLfg9tBx\nPshySqvShBH4LOD38SBi\n=byy5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree d70202df3a44ec7e57888d30e50f834cedb85d4a\nparent e636ce9e979fd1c30335ec340acdabbd0a5ae79e\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1780431804 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780431804 -0400\n\nfix(code): serialize cold SDK imports (#3712)\n\nCold import paths that enter the Deep Agents SDK now share a\nprocess-local reentrant lock, avoiding CPython import deadlock failures\nwhen startup, skill discovery, and token-budget code hit overlapping\nmodule graphs at the same time. Model creation and skill discovery run\nthrough locked helpers so worker-thread paths use the same import gate\nwithout blocking the event loop.\n\n## Changes\n- Added `_DEEPAGENTS_IMPORT_LOCK` as a process-local `RLock` for Deep\nAgents SDK import entry points that can be reached concurrently during\ncold startup.\n- Routed model creation through\n`_create_model_with_deepagents_import_lock`, including server startup,\nrestored-thread model recreation, and token-budget model construction.\n- Routed skill discovery through\n`_discover_skills_and_roots_with_import_lock` for startup discovery and\ncache-miss `/skill` invocation paths.\n- Wrapped prewarm imports and summarization-default imports with the\nshared import gate so prewarm, skill discovery, and model setup do not\nrace through the same module graph.\n\n## Testing\n- Added coverage that cache-miss skill invocation uses the guarded\ndiscovery path instead of calling `_discover_skills_and_roots` directly.\n- Updated the startup import-gate test to assert model creation waits on\nthe shared process-level import lock.","verified_at":"2026-06-02T20:23:25Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fb2adc0585e978b12646602ba922e252abf41f81","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/fb2adc0585e978b12646602ba922e252abf41f81","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fb2adc0585e978b12646602ba922e252abf41f81/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e636ce9e979fd1c30335ec340acdabbd0a5ae79e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e636ce9e979fd1c30335ec340acdabbd0a5ae79e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e636ce9e979fd1c30335ec340acdabbd0a5ae79e"}]},{"sha":"e636ce9e979fd1c30335ec340acdabbd0a5ae79e","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGU2MzZjZTllOTc5ZmQxYzMwMzM1ZWMzNDBhY2RhYmJkMGE1YWU3OWU","commit":{"author":{"name":"open-swe[bot]","email":"215916821+open-swe[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-02T19:59:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-02T19:59:29Z"},"message":"fix(code): preserve extras during install (#3707)\n\n`/install <extra>` and `dcode --install <extra>` now preserve\nalready-installed extras when reinstalling the uv tool, so adding one\nprovider no longer removes another. The install command builder unions\ndetected installed extras with the requested extra, validates each name,\nand keeps CLI failure/manual messages aligned with the command that\nruns.\n\n_Opened collaboratively by Mason Daugherty and open-swe._\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <61371264+mdrxy@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c3f759597a2853417fc9b6b8833bc2b8dc823bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/4c3f759597a2853417fc9b6b8833bc2b8dc823bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/e636ce9e979fd1c30335ec340acdabbd0a5ae79e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHzYhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMcgQACBR5B3jyJw4z7jA4YSx+ARA\nb/ABEYUGPQ1Eoo8zUcq3/i9lMKwaHMvgLDfvizPTd2VgPeJn4OJeKJv4wUmGttsR\nruO3FoCem8bFheOI707+XBQjDCGOVKa7vs7wrMpK+0jouNVo17UcXicT5AcaK0sT\n1toIzufK3z2A4yeWHgNfrkHIckyR2hIn+52ZYZW/6561vD87uWTo7o9L9fC/Z34a\ndu9KcNS9Jk682Ee9bkcLE7IugU5jxCFdTCS09PVXyIYn7NE91OYgRbK+b83328Lg\nkoy/c6raM9PmIuvjcfJfLSj22N5InIO3uLNxr2736zRgTtnVib3v6fQwMbAjOQH9\nFVzGzxRLY57ZQwx9t5MH0W9XDe+y0BfY3g238uR8XLpFvXOrdy+qICCquFs4Y0XX\n8X0kKCt8frn6dCOMCNK08awymS/yMGMWdcVeUWNNWjOr9ZKJLWvhS+6OCxllDYYA\nkz0P/ZteEeaI1LErOPRX9HLTfg/sxJHywWOba8prtaHwd5NVOMTZk10B537Rrp28\n40MlN32i4H7l8eCSPNDkdJHxohhKQGMju3zn7EDb4HTg67yYS7hHwGC920JiItur\nP9DluqKvmLTe4cH5vZ6RfI/X7GPU3RUB0kywkrC2CP5PGDDJO+VoQaL7VUTNylHw\n/uqOm6jFNwaIVgFakl6L\n=Nj6Q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 4c3f759597a2853417fc9b6b8833bc2b8dc823bb\nparent 307d59826da9b1ddcbcdab8dccef6d18ecf16d10\nauthor open-swe[bot] <215916821+open-swe[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1780430369 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780430369 -0400\n\nfix(code): preserve extras during install (#3707)\n\n`/install <extra>` and `dcode --install <extra>` now preserve\nalready-installed extras when reinstalling the uv tool, so adding one\nprovider no longer removes another. The install command builder unions\ndetected installed extras with the requested extra, validates each name,\nand keeps CLI failure/manual messages aligned with the command that\nruns.\n\n_Opened collaboratively by Mason Daugherty and open-swe._\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <61371264+mdrxy@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-02T19:59:30Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e636ce9e979fd1c30335ec340acdabbd0a5ae79e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e636ce9e979fd1c30335ec340acdabbd0a5ae79e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e636ce9e979fd1c30335ec340acdabbd0a5ae79e/comments","author":{"login":"open-swe[bot]","id":215916821,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODN6hFQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1395372?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/open-swe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"307d59826da9b1ddcbcdab8dccef6d18ecf16d10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/307d59826da9b1ddcbcdab8dccef6d18ecf16d10","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/307d59826da9b1ddcbcdab8dccef6d18ecf16d10"}]},{"sha":"307d59826da9b1ddcbcdab8dccef6d18ecf16d10","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDMwN2Q1OTgyNmRhOWIxZGRjYmNkYWI4ZGNjZWY2ZDE4ZWNmMTZkMTA","commit":{"author":{"name":"open-swe[bot]","email":"215916821+open-swe[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-02T19:18:07Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-02T19:18:07Z"},"message":"fix(code): serialize `QueuedUserMessage` as user input (#3708)\n\n## Description\n`QueuedUserMessage` instances can be present during snapshots, but\nserialization treated them as unknown app messages. Serialize them as\nuser messages so queued input keeps its identity and content.\n\n## Release Note\nFix queued user messages being persisted as generic app messages.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] Added coverage for `QueuedUserMessage` serialization without\nunknown-widget warnings.\n\n_Opened collaboratively by Mason Daugherty and open-swe._\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <61371264+mdrxy@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"47aad9fb1c2e14599a1bc4b8c6ce13a46c63fa88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/47aad9fb1c2e14599a1bc4b8c6ce13a46c63fa88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/307d59826da9b1ddcbcdab8dccef6d18ecf16d10","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHyxvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADH0QAAscYQlXmxYh06khNDaBJSpT\nEW2PXgXA16b/OyORUYTj4o93OvV5F3thLLmpki50sTzOntkqctnPS7qvrBaqcAUk\nT2PS/sJdeMNEO6JEvyhd7LbCBzeCO/1AzjPby82vR2PVbs5/VuVB0PnmD/F8PFpp\nCW1k8B5VtiPQuuHWn6kH1JmWGUlrtgS/hu0VT3aOJ84Jh5F4zoXGg4qqybv1m0SB\ncFUbokSCFTkpxfnXL0JuOG1VGn/werW2aardkIptkiwlkWKwywjVJc4arsKstZ+8\nlcWhZxQqyPSFODOQBI9Sv/mV36kGLqQUnorSyaK62/DspdiHw/SQcfZcIaWzgAiX\nVmUFSEex/zFW8VI2DiNJ8Bk2eNizfJnrczylnu1THvQ7QIHFHCrGpMy+fgIATNZD\nWltWO0YOmPtPxonKtpmxS3C2jey7qrOjVZ7ryorBnNcPwBC3xVrycX5WGEqn8GXX\nt7SUpDQL9Y/ltB9XIQelJ0mxfPub89mmAiWNtpkq0xbaibXCMHfLMNUjeCZMFqBP\nBqiBI9/YGBx3QECzWHi7KLka2DfVLW4ufvBxa2YqR8KRHwXhXnvmqEgEqa2RS18H\nNJEEVWv6RmARI8nqW2ujDuQ23G24xyNd6y5NJFY/HUZe82s9J4JMnWONim+5+Mc3\nqMZnmTPapomm9LKugUkI\n=tf6y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 47aad9fb1c2e14599a1bc4b8c6ce13a46c63fa88\nparent 727d022cd1526836c3d1de997c1f036e870881f7\nauthor open-swe[bot] <215916821+open-swe[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1780427887 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780427887 -0400\n\nfix(code): serialize `QueuedUserMessage` as user input (#3708)\n\n## Description\n`QueuedUserMessage` instances can be present during snapshots, but\nserialization treated them as unknown app messages. Serialize them as\nuser messages so queued input keeps its identity and content.\n\n## Release Note\nFix queued user messages being persisted as generic app messages.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] Added coverage for `QueuedUserMessage` serialization without\nunknown-widget warnings.\n\n_Opened collaboratively by Mason Daugherty and open-swe._\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <61371264+mdrxy@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-02T19:18:07Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/307d59826da9b1ddcbcdab8dccef6d18ecf16d10","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/307d59826da9b1ddcbcdab8dccef6d18ecf16d10","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/307d59826da9b1ddcbcdab8dccef6d18ecf16d10/comments","author":{"login":"open-swe[bot]","id":215916821,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODN6hFQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1395372?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/open-swe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"727d022cd1526836c3d1de997c1f036e870881f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/727d022cd1526836c3d1de997c1f036e870881f7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/727d022cd1526836c3d1de997c1f036e870881f7"}]},{"sha":"727d022cd1526836c3d1de997c1f036e870881f7","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDcyN2QwMjJjZDE1MjY4MzZjM2QxZGU5OTdjMWYwMzZlODcwODgxZjc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-02T18:16:46Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-02T18:16:46Z"},"message":"fix(code): allow recovery commands when startup fails (#3706)\n\nWhen a configured model's provider package can't be imported, the model\nis built *before* the LangGraph server starts, so construction fails and\nthe app holds a `_server_startup_error` state that parks queued slash\ncommands until a successful start drains them. `/install` — the command\nthat installs the missing package — is `QUEUED`, so it was trapped\nbehind the very failure it repairs: typing `/install <pkg>` appeared to\nhang because it never ran. `/model` and `/auth` already escaped this\nwedge via `IMMEDIATE_UI`, but the package-recovery path did not.","tree":{"sha":"5934a815508d0623cf7394f8246644451bbe482f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5934a815508d0623cf7394f8246644451bbe482f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/727d022cd1526836c3d1de997c1f036e870881f7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHx4OCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVKwQAJhdZGtUNzEBTFGheMmOUN6H\nX78uSXWX29Y0J/sDxV8nQvcRlHexdWk9M2+UQ+8vFfXpDHk/FAGT3aVkOT0kBDan\nJ9vUwH0X3WqWTD0E4yZjYesvlamkzAovyhrAfEIsHPb3nYH1TkZJox9aAkpt0sym\nD4I0aZjwMnzPaETT95W1U3u20hSgC1wPNGYix6TQ2vOJZfbO/LCC+8Kxfu7KivEg\n/KupEBjkJgMISOSQYIdtK411NL0BfsUR3wHsUzk7qJpA2c1WWx+4VTHKYZsoERg5\nM6Kio1shLas+pGKBNzjdgiUFolTKVRJsoeJAe7GDvrBhFUnKGdGY0Zok4IyP/Aoc\nBKZ+ZleKWT47fd9rp6XnHkiLSzH0WhDjmzi8hpkK8GLS848WaCnmpSD9aP4poLlx\nqV8jahUar/Ev6zOIyIy6t4paQowXPSjxu/3tIv6jtc7bjkDLuUFdsBW9mv2qn45S\nbNk0cqMGCyMGjeri5JUXM7w8XODmSGkRGXAwq0pjs/AfBsW2ET2jDq/eIL0QSPM6\nljCleX6i8GqvIgJbJOYKMgC3WswtZQNUu+m21HGusI1yn61RoaJ2EJs4RKJ6RQ0f\npNFD33c4QD0rrGILvzwenWhwNzEGT+c+CSkIHON66UwWOEc1xv7hYTL1yZoZ3w2G\nQOpp4iAFdyN2GUrvXRlH\n=Y487\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5934a815508d0623cf7394f8246644451bbe482f\nparent d5e03117c8663284c4cae77e6d727faf44d03d49\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1780424206 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780424206 -0400\n\nfix(code): allow recovery commands when startup fails (#3706)\n\nWhen a configured model's provider package can't be imported, the model\nis built *before* the LangGraph server starts, so construction fails and\nthe app holds a `_server_startup_error` state that parks queued slash\ncommands until a successful start drains them. `/install` — the command\nthat installs the missing package — is `QUEUED`, so it was trapped\nbehind the very failure it repairs: typing `/install <pkg>` appeared to\nhang because it never ran. `/model` and `/auth` already escaped this\nwedge via `IMMEDIATE_UI`, but the package-recovery path did not.","verified_at":"2026-06-02T18:16:47Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/727d022cd1526836c3d1de997c1f036e870881f7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/727d022cd1526836c3d1de997c1f036e870881f7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/727d022cd1526836c3d1de997c1f036e870881f7/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"d5e03117c8663284c4cae77e6d727faf44d03d49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d5e03117c8663284c4cae77e6d727faf44d03d49","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d5e03117c8663284c4cae77e6d727faf44d03d49"}]},{"sha":"d5e03117c8663284c4cae77e6d727faf44d03d49","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGQ1ZTAzMTE3Yzg2NjMyODRjNGNhZTc3ZTZkNzI3ZmFmNDRkMDNkNDk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-02T17:57:24Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-02T17:57:24Z"},"message":"docs(ci): document developing a new version line (#3705)\n\n`RELEASING.md` had no guidance for working on a version line that's\ndecoupled from `main` — e.g. staging `0.7` while `main` keeps shipping\n`0.6.x`, or patching `0.6.x` after `main` moves on. This documents that\nworkflow end to end, grounded in the actual branch-protection rulesets.","tree":{"sha":"ca3893d36ea26c562431a554e4e8f03acb26c254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/ca3893d36ea26c562431a554e4e8f03acb26c254"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/d5e03117c8663284c4cae77e6d727faf44d03d49","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHxmECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAV70QAGN7WMyftJwyPtNzyiBVtY4b\nocB9nAeoNoG2LFhQvTgGI95DLM+qUclv4dHoql09pU5X82yDt+VyBeXRtXHSJ5BF\nKLGBZSI+9x/8vqdcr+p6lkIrYSyqR7aF6uKzQ3TrH7fDXR78+ruzSlYT8pazbZH7\nbgf+SP/Hh2Kk9hLTMIizq2Tsq8nLEEzMFy+h256LRR24TvSFYqcevVfOtEJ2NyCa\nzrn6tnklCHNW5gEQqmIB+3gVghuUirPjePAbD4kYpVOeqLl2unHZ6YF3sLxIgmGZ\nW177mFML2mqVOSYagvDBCm16oZiFWXkp/DmhfVgPWCPg36mfhEW7R0zLzrQ2JKuz\n5M4b66o1gCHCeqcz/m6h9JyAHUWFzFAWzzGszcBt75lU1AlSwE85oXuWn114PD/X\nq8FDHfu3CvQCfdBW5s/OdgqgId+RSqnD+udLxRnK7bkY2xItL3YxUWIQoG5KGo1S\ncbn6XUK+lPuvu86jE6Ddk1TG7m9uF1Z4gtmYHqjoRx2jOkppe6T3Z2SBSANZUVek\nkmJ8CfW/PZG27ZQ6UroJ45d5p2rebqCG1x130dmU2Ntn/7yVoqyWhmVeSQsWu45k\nYVaM04U97dESIXIXTynkXpa12kzypkJ7sYJ9rHxTueZdE7RN7WiEHVAcan5iW253\n2kn4TjE/nALCfNQM6JIQ\n=7Fi/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ca3893d36ea26c562431a554e4e8f03acb26c254\nparent b67aead2b86e04aaee8f2dbfba7b263e3e23597d\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1780423044 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780423044 +0000\n\ndocs(ci): document developing a new version line (#3705)\n\n`RELEASING.md` had no guidance for working on a version line that's\ndecoupled from `main` — e.g. staging `0.7` while `main` keeps shipping\n`0.6.x`, or patching `0.6.x` after `main` moves on. This documents that\nworkflow end to end, grounded in the actual branch-protection rulesets.","verified_at":"2026-06-02T17:57:25Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d5e03117c8663284c4cae77e6d727faf44d03d49","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d5e03117c8663284c4cae77e6d727faf44d03d49","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d5e03117c8663284c4cae77e6d727faf44d03d49/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b67aead2b86e04aaee8f2dbfba7b263e3e23597d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b67aead2b86e04aaee8f2dbfba7b263e3e23597d","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b67aead2b86e04aaee8f2dbfba7b263e3e23597d"}]},{"sha":"b67aead2b86e04aaee8f2dbfba7b263e3e23597d","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGI2N2FlYWQyYjg2ZTA0YWFlZThmMmRiZmJhN2IyNjNlM2UyMzU5N2Q","commit":{"author":{"name":"open-swe[bot]","email":"215916821+open-swe[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-02T15:46:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-02T15:46:58Z"},"message":"fix(code): normalize empty file list tool output (#3697)\n\nNormalizes empty `ls` and `glob` tool outputs in deepagents-code so\nagents see `No files found` instead of raw `[]` while preserving errors\nand non-empty results.\n\n_Opened collaboratively by Mason Daugherty and open-swe._\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <61371264+mdrxy@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"15a93eb777f8d6ac5fb0f827b3536e3c495dcfe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/15a93eb777f8d6ac5fb0f827b3536e3c495dcfe2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/b67aead2b86e04aaee8f2dbfba7b263e3e23597d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHvryCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYKwQAH/c59poBLtBUuApCdPvKgBS\n57JGzTPYn3jjRr5ZaCBrNMXKL8C94jb/5Yx3cX9xht8Fqd4KQKjWhFrphxUPFbtR\nIBwVr141COw8J5eTIwGGOZsek+31+nvmTGqVMPOQPocKM65V9xokKHkzdZcmisuA\n+1i+4/etOmgm71/9tAVSOL6TmW/ZPukKPkz3ezf8fVjnTwv6WwMStZOYJaLbsXoD\nM00aCjxrc4NADpqc/5OcWrf0l2eQQsf0JdlU1Jc0EZpDhDsTzRJtheXvidx3BOTf\nY17IBiJQFRKoEcHpW6XGw0+nOGzK5XXxWO+5EasCR8iPP1MKJO4Dbmg6ntu0nXp1\nPZ0uIZiRlDp/r/944s6fUr8BTm8CY5TiOvhFbbeIgydcWTrVItKS+tH3E/2zbNuT\nggwUKTcIMyC1wFIn0k5njBwUEW65/1jE74tz4b4OprxXAVCggY6xTvZPAti3JvDX\nHXlbmygYzDQExrqVl32Gmxdf98bohyAMmXtqrLDYD+EaomZ34rbRZxLbMCRTQ+5+\nhONaC3j1fbG/PRNFSj1cphSridWAODjPIdlmGwFLpP6B8xQn+XWQPBuQVCv1JGqL\nUAak0oO1XK/2DeAHSQfyE+Im8wpCZyB/FDD9iE0fWGjjN//SqWJLnhsPBeEZs/aS\nqnPktRrCB7hX3XaBq+Wt\n=EB4P\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 15a93eb777f8d6ac5fb0f827b3536e3c495dcfe2\nparent 6d9126e64ccf72cc0b77efa64073f7d7adbc17d4\nauthor open-swe[bot] <215916821+open-swe[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1780415218 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780415218 -0400\n\nfix(code): normalize empty file list tool output (#3697)\n\nNormalizes empty `ls` and `glob` tool outputs in deepagents-code so\nagents see `No files found` instead of raw `[]` while preserving errors\nand non-empty results.\n\n_Opened collaboratively by Mason Daugherty and open-swe._\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <61371264+mdrxy@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-02T15:46:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b67aead2b86e04a